# Cmdr. Troi, Outgoing Empath: "If they do, you copy that spell ... If they don't, you draw a card." Bot2 is offered the free
# cast on its own turn and declines, so nothing is copied, no damage is dealt, the Bolt stays in Bot2's hand (it cost nothing to
# keep it), and Bot1 draws a card. Lightning Greaves gives Troi haste, so the {T} ability can be activated on Bot2's turn.

